# Claude: alleen de gedeelde instellingen en skills committen
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
# Persoonlijke AI-instructies. Gedeelde instructies staan in AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md en .agent/.
.agent/**/personal/
# CLAUDE.local.md is je persoonlijke variant van CLAUDE.md. Claude Code laadt hem naast CLAUDE.md.
CLAUDE.local.md
# Beslissingenlog per branch, zie .agent/documentation/decision-log.md
.beslissingen/

test/requests/.env

# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.bkp
*/t
# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work

# Uitvoer en tijdelijke bestanden, in elke map
output/
tmp/
temp/
# cmd/fenix/output is Go-code (package output): de .go-bestanden blijven in git,
# uitvoer van een run vanuit cmd/fenix niet
!cmd/fenix/output/
cmd/fenix/output/*
!cmd/fenix/output/*.go

# Environment variable files
*.env
.env

cmd/artdecor/conceptmap_*.csv

terminology/conceptmaps/fhir/converted/

# Sensitive parameter files — keep only templates tracked
test/**/parameters.*.json
!test/**/parameters.template.json

config/config.yaml
!config/config.example.yaml